WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Morning on the Saltmere breakwater.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.800
The ferry leaves at seven,
as it has for forty years.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
[gulls calling]

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.000
Tide&apos;s turning. We should check
the mooring buoys.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.000
The lighthouse keeper logs
every boat that passes.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.500
♪ brass band playing ♪

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.500
Harbour office, this is the pilot launch.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.000
Fog rolls in from the outer mole by noon.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:25.000
Keep to the marked channel
past the red buoy.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.000
By evening the quay is quiet again.

